          "printed_page": 800,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Good prognosis but refractory cases may require more aggressive therapy (e.g., up to 1% tacrolimus) or surgery (e.g., parotid duct transposition).",
